The TEW-829DRU is a quad core wifi router+switch combo with dual-wan capability and an eight port gigabit switch. It supports 802.11a/b/g (2.4GHz) along with 802.11n (up to 400 Mbps @ 256QAM) and 802.11ac (5GHz1: up to 1733 Mbps, 5GHz2: up to 867 Mbps @ 256QAM). An RJ-45 -> DB-9 cable for the serial console port is included in the retail packaging. It runs OpenWRT Chaos Calmer from the OEM with a heavily customized LuCI web management interface.

